(42, NULL, 'Irma Umar', NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, NULL, 'I have been going to Look Smart Salon for almost 10 years, and my experience has always been absolutely amazing! ❤️ She is extremely cooperative, positive, professional, and genuinely dedicated to providing the best services to her clients.\n\nWhat I love most is the attention to detail. She and her staff take proper time with every client, listen carefully, and discuss each and every detail before providing the service. Her makeup and hairstyling are simply 200% perfect! Every time, I leave the salon completely satisfied and happy.\n\nHer staff is also highly professional, well-mannered, and attentive. The quality of service is truly exceptional, especially considering the very reasonable and affordable charges.\n\nIn my opinion, Look Smart Salon is one of the best service providers in Lahore at such reasonable prices. I would highly recommend it to everyone looking for professional, reliable, and excellent beauty services.\n\n2000% HIGHLY RECOMMENDED! ❤️✨', 'approved', 'google', NULL, '2026-10-18 09:08:00', 0, '2026-11-17 10:08:00', '2026-11-17 10:08:00', NULL),
(43, NULL, 'Shakeela Shahzad', NULL, NULL, NULL, 5, NULL, 'Had an amazing experience at the salon today. The staff was super friendly and professional, taking their time to understand exactly what I wanted instead of rushing through. The place was spotless, well-maintained, and had a great relaxing vibe. Absolutely loved the final results and will definitely be coming back. Highly recommended to anyone looking for quality service.', 'approved', 'google', NULL, '2026-10-17 09:08:00', 0, '2026-11-17 10:08:00', '2026-11-17 10:08:00', NULL),
